<h1>Tessellry User Manual</h1>
<p class="tm-sub">Version 1.5.0 &middot; by Rekluz Labs</p>

<p>Tessellry (formerly Tile Harvest) is an Android app for taking grid images apart and putting photo grids together. Everything runs on your device. Nothing is uploaded, and no account is needed.</p>

<p><strong>What you can do with it:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Split a Sheet:</strong> turn one image full of items (sprite sheets, scanned cards, mahjong tiles, stamps, photo grids) into individual, named image files, a ZIP, or a game-ready sprite atlas.</li>
  <li><strong>Create a Contact Sheet:</strong> combine up to 56 photos into one numbered, print-ready grid image or PDF.</li>
</ul>

