<p><strong>Split a Sheet:</strong> choose mode &rarr; load sheet &rarr; pick template &rarr; review names &rarr; fix edges or layout if needed &rarr; export (Files, ZIP, or Atlas).</p>
<p><strong>Contact Sheet:</strong> add photos &rarr; drag to reorder &rarr; choose canvas &rarr; set margin, gutter, and numbers &rarr; choose format &rarr; export.</p>
<p><strong>Defaults:</strong></p>
<div class="tm-table"><table>
  <tr><th>Setting</th><th>Default</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Detection mode</td><td>Tiles</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Template</td><td>Picture Frame</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Output format</td><td>PNG</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Tile resolution</td><td>512 px</td></tr>
